// ===== PYQ-RESTORE-1 PR-2 (2026-10-18) - Science =====
//
// Same method as PR-1, for the 88 served Science `PYQ-S-*` rows filed under Others: each located in
// the official Science (086) question paper of its year by its `ncertRef` set code (31/x/x), compared
